-- Native cases for Lists: growth, update, slicing, searching, sorting, joining
-- and the loop and callback functions, in place or sharing, with managed
-- children and every Int bound. Each program compiles once within its ceiling,
-- then runs once per case with exact stdout, status and strict allocation counts.
import:
    test: TestSuite
    ../driver/harness: Program, exits_with, prints, repeated, reported, verify_program


